==Notes==

* Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
* The caster level is capped at 20.
* When [[empower spell|empowered]], the caster level is added to the damage twice &mdash; once before increasing the damage 50% and once after ''(a bug)''. (A fix for this is available on the Vault<sup>[http://nwvault.ign.com/View.php?view=Scripts.Detail&id=3739]</sup>.)
* Due to a .2da bug, ''healing circle'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.
* Although the spell description specifies 'all enemies', a bug causes the spell to damage the caster as well, if the caster is within the area of effect.

